    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Paris-based libre/open-source type foundry (VTF), founded 2010 by Frank Adebiaye, first Francophone foundry to release open-source fonts. Now a fluid collective, team page lists 11 active members (the Directing Collective) plus alumni and published-designer contributors; no single figurehead runs it day to day, so no Autonomy estimate set (org, not solo). Notable typefaces: Terminal Grotesque, VG5000, Trickster, Combat, Resistance, Compagnon, Avara, Steps Mono, Hyper Scrypt. Also runs workshops, a custom/commission arm, and community projects (Velvetyne Libre Friends on GitLab). Instagram (25k followers) is self-described as a sleepy account, they prefer email/Mastodon/newsletter over IG DMs. No LinkedIn company page found after searching (checked twice); likely genuinely absent given the collective/indie structure.",
      "source_url": null,
      "verified_at": "2026-07-26T23:09:43",
